  "description": "Build an unbeatable haunted house of nightmares. In HauntedManager, you'll manage guests, money, and mischievous ghosts while enjoying simple top-down tower defense gameplay.\n\n・You've become the manager of a haunted house!\n・Spook guests and chase them out before they make it to the finish line.\n・Manage your team of mischievous ghosts.\n・Usher crying guests toward the exit so they don't spoil the experience for others.\n・Elite guests from the Main Shrine will come to taunt you. Beat them at their own game and have them join your team.\n\nGhost Staff Members -\n・Doppelganger: Not even she knows who she's a copy of, making her basically just another human.\n・Crasher: An entity that once dominated the world, though now so well-known that no one fears her.\n・Hasshaku: An urban legend of internet origins who doles out physical attacks. Also good at basketball.\n...And more!",
